---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout 
  title="Cookie Policy | Studyinfo"
  description="Learn about how we use cookies to improve your experience on Studyinfo."
>
  <div class="legal-page">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
      <p>Last updated: January 2025</p>
      <p>This Cookie Policy explains how Studyinfo uses cookies and similar technologies to recognize you when you visit our website.</p>

      <h2>1. What are cookies?</h2>
      <p>Cookies are small data files that are placed on your computer or mobile device when you visit a website. Cookies are widely used by website owners in order to make their websites work, or to work more efficiently, as well as to provide reporting information.</p>

      <h2>2. Why do we use cookies?</h2>
      <p>We use cookies for several reasons. Some cookies are required for technical reasons in order for our Website to operate, and we refer to these as "essential" or "strictly necessary" cookies. Other cookies also enable us to track and target the interests of our users to enhance the experience on our Online Properties.</p>

      <h2>3. How can I control cookies?</h2>
      <p>You have the right to decide whether to accept or reject cookies. You can exercise your cookie rights by setting your browser preferences.</p>

      <h2>4. Updates to this policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Cookie Policy from time to time in order to reflect, for example, changes to the cookies we use or for other operational, legal or regulatory reasons.</p>

      <h2>5. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions about our use of cookies or other technologies, please email us at help@studyinfo.net.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding: 4rem 0;
    background-color: var(--canvas-black);
    color: var(--muted-text);
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .container {
    max-width: 56rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1rem;
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: 1.07px;
    color: var(--hazard-white);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    color: var(--hazard-white);
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  p {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
</style>
